# onidia-package - the shared build/release layer for the Onidia apps:
# the Makefile, packaging/, the bundled agents, docs and the release notes.
#
# This workspace also holds independent projects, each with its own
# repository. Those nested repos are listed below and must never be
# nested inside onidia-package.

# --- Other repositories living in this workspace (each has its own .git) ---
/onidia/
/onidia-chat/
/web/
/registry/

# --- Local planning / scratch notes - not part of the package ---
/plan_*.md

# --- Build output (the Makefile writes packages here) ---
/dist/

# --- Large binaries, downloaded wheels, loose dev screenshots ---
*.mkv
*.whl
/chat_ui_*.png

# --- Compiled Python (agents are plain .py; ship sources, not bytecode) ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
*~
